WEBVTT

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:10.020
Saint Seiya

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:00.060
Damn you, Saga.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:05.400
To use the forbidden Athena
Exclamation to defeat Shaka.

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:08.470
That's low.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:11.500
You will not be forgiven.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:18.360
Saga, why? Why do you
have to take it that far?

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:27.340
Shaka, I'll avenge your death.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.010
For sure.

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:35.840
Forgive me, Shaka.

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:47.760
Shaka. Shaka.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:57.750
You must not forget, death is not the end.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:05.660
Those born as the chosen ones

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.690
have all overcome death.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:16.380
Shaka, if you can achieve that,

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.910
though you were born a man,

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:25.240
you will become the one closest to God.

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:35.980
The Golden Clash

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.910
The two somehow survived.

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:56.830
Out of the five senses
only my hearing remains.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:01.150
I can still speak.

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:03.510
I just have my vision.

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:09.880
The three of us combined
can see, hear and speak.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:13.600
What's wrong, Saga?

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.890
What are you looking at?

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:25.990
Shaka.

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:28.390
How could this be?

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:32.110
The Athena Exclamation, as
powerful as the Big Bang,

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:36.100
obliterates everything.

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.830
Then how?

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:50.770
Wait.

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:14.270
A flower blooms then wilts.

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:18.000
A star shines then fades.

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:22.500
The Earth, the sun, the galaxy.

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:28.210
And the universe will one day end.

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:47.200
Relatively, a man's life is but an instant.

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:56.270
During that instant man is born,
laughs, cries, fights, hurts.

00:07:56.590 --> 00:08:01.450
Rejoices, grieves, hates and loves others.

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:04.950
All is transitory.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:14.760
And everyone falls into the
eternal sleep of death.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:37.600
He's writing something on
the flower petal with blood.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.480
Writing his dying message with blood.

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:44.960
Then I'll show him mercy by taking his head.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.460
A... La... Ya... Vijnana...

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:53.540
Wind, carry it away.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:59.340
To Athena.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.880
Are you finished?

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.660
In that case.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:18.200
Sorry!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.890
Just as I thought.

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:31.160
Shaka was already dead.

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:38.550
His spirit came back to the Sala
garden to leave his dying message.

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:02.160
Shaka, I'm sorry.

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:06.810
I confess the truth to you.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:11.360
We promise, on your soul.

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:17.000
Butterfly of the Underworld, Fairies.

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:20.920
We're being watched by Hades.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:33.710
This is in memory of Shaka. Receive it.

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:50.610
Move out of the way, Mu!

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:02.840
Get up.

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:06.940
Get up and come at me at
once like you did to Shaka.

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:09.410
This time I'll take you on.

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:20.600
Now, what's the matter? I'm telling you to
unleash the Athena Exclamation once again.

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:24.470
Have you bastards lost the will to fight?

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:29.180
Aioria has such tremendous strength.

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:33.140
Against the angered lion, we have no chance.

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:36.190
There's nothing we can do.

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:40.890
If you don't, I'll kill you all here.

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:43.020
Return to the Underworld.

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.910
Repent to Shaka!

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.840
What? Mu.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.910
Why do you interfere? Let go.

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:58.950
Aioria, they're barely alive
after Shaka's Treasure of Heaven.

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:02.080
They can cause no damage.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:06.970
There's no point in killing them.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:07.810
What?

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:10.730
Why did Shaka die?

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:16.040
I think there is some deeper meaning to it.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:22.300
Mu, I'm tired of your preaching.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:26.730
You can't stop me!

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:28.210
Aioria.

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:31.010
I don't need your philosophical thesis.

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:37.930
But to do nothing after witnessing
your friend be murdered.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:42.100
I cannot acknowledge you
as a Saint, as a man!

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:45.140
They are no longer Gold Saints.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:47.890
They are scum that bow to Hades!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.850
So it's no use.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:53.810
Enough! This is Shaka!

00:13:58.510 --> 00:14:00.590
Lightening Plasma!

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:12.080
He stopped the force of
the Lightening Plasma.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:18.360
Aioria, I would like for you
to avenge Shaka's death too.

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:23.870
But I can't be defeated here by you.

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:25.510
What did you say?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:30.230
We have four hours left.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:35.930
We need to reach Athena.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:41.080
Whoever gets in the way
will end up like Shaka.

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:43.410
Dead.

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:50.020
Interesting.

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:53.540
My turn to speak.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:02.380
I won't let you escape.
I'll kill all of you here.

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:22.510
This is the Sala tree flower
petal from the Virgo house.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:28.840
It's like it traveled
here from another world.

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:36.560
Shaka, what are you trying to tell me?

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:39.740
Miro.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:50.340
Miro, you abandoned the Scorpio house.

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:52.880
I couldn't sit still.

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:54.300
Take this!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.560
The crimson impact!

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:02.180
Scarlet Needle!

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:10.880
Shaka has been defeated. I can't
just wait in the Scorpio house.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:14.690
All I have to do is take care of these three.

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:24.340
I'll do it myself!

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.610
Surrender or die.

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:42.100
The Scarlet Needle gives its victim
to think during the fifteen blows.

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:47.000
But you don't have no reason to think.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.470
All that is left for you is death.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:57.420
Now, return to the Underworld
and repent to Shaka.

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:03.080
This is the finishing Antares.

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:04.340
Watch out!

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:33.500
Miro.

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:46.140
If Seiya didn't warn me,
I would've been done.

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:50.290
That was Saga's ultimate attack.

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:54.850
Galaxian Explosion.

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:05.330
I told you, we only have four hours left.

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:12.830
We will kill anyone who gets
in the way, like Shaka.

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:20.330
Nonsense. You had four of your
senses destroyed by Shaka.

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:23.930
Got hit with Aioria's Lightning Plasma.

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:29.410
And took fourteen blows of my Scarlet Needle.

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:36.250
Where do they still have
the strength to fight?

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:40.060
Why? Why do you go so far to fight?

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:42.680
Everything is for Athena.

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:46.760
Do you think so much
about Athena, Miss Saori?

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:48.360
What?

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.360
You guys!

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:52.100
What's that three in one pose?

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:32.670
There is one character written on the petal.

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:37.480
Is this Shaka's message to me?

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:39.440
A...

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.450
La...

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:43.400
Ya...

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:45.360
Vijnana...

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:48.200
The eighth sense.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.140
Shaka,

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:05.160
I finally understand the
meaning of your death.

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:11.100
And now I have decided.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:40.330
We're out of strength, barely
standing by our remaining Cosmo.

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:44.250
There's only one way out.

00:20:44.860 --> 00:20:46.840
None other than this.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:53.250
We've already committed sin.

00:20:53.520 --> 00:21:01.560
There's nothing holding us back from
using the Athena Exclamation again.

00:21:04.420 --> 00:21:11.570
We'll kill you all here like we did Shaka.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:16.250
Camus.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:16.710
Shura.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.450
Stay calm.

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:25.510
Saga, haven't you forgotten something?

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:33.230
There are three Gold Saints on this side too.

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:36.200
We have no choice.

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:39.650
What are you saying, Mu?

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:48.200
What?

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:51.780
What's this?

00:21:57.860 --> 00:21:59.800
Athena Exclamation!

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:02.450
Stop! It's sacrilegious.

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:06.930
What will happen when two
Athena Exclamations clash?

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:13.180
If Athena Exclamations with the
force of the Big Bang collide.

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:29.100
The force won't just double,
it'll expand infinitely.

00:22:29.380 --> 00:22:30.490
In that case.

00:22:30.590 --> 00:22:33.240
Not only the Virgo house, all twelve houses,

00:22:33.310 --> 00:22:37.570
the entire Sanctuary will be obliterated.

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:43.850
Then why?

00:22:44.470 --> 00:22:46.220
Saga. Mu.

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:52.180
Why do you choose an attack
that would wipe out everyone?

00:22:53.630 --> 00:22:58.470
They're serious. They're betting everything.

00:22:58.580 --> 00:23:01.370
Can't we resolve this some other way?

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:08.770
If everything is destroyed,

00:23:08.890 --> 00:23:12.090
it'll save us the trouble of killing Athena.

00:23:12.520 --> 00:23:14.190
I don't know about that.

00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:18.790
Seiya, Shun, Hyoga, Shiryu. Protect Athena.

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:22.790
Saga, even for the sake of
Shaka I will take you all down.

00:23:23.140 --> 00:23:26.750
Fine, let's not waste any more time.

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:30.460
Enough talking.

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:31.680
Here I come!

00:23:33.560 --> 00:23:34.850
Fools.

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:36.130
I'll show you.

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:37.350
Farewell.

00:23:37.960 --> 00:23:40.060
Stop it!

00:23:49.230 --> 00:23:52.620
Athena Exclamation!

00:25:36.280 --> 00:25:38.180
The shining sun rises.

00:25:38.910 --> 00:25:42.770
After the night of lament, Saga's
flood of emotions are left.

00:25:43.360 --> 00:25:46.480
We pledge to his passionate soul.

00:25:46.800 --> 00:25:49.560
We will risk death in order to defeat Hades.

00:25:50.240 --> 00:25:53.100
Saint Seiya, "Shaking Sanctuary."

00:25:53.330 --> 00:25:56.100
"The Cloth of Athena," "The
Morning of Resolution."

00:25:56.480 --> 00:25:59.390
Do you sense the Cosmo?
